  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice apple into wedges.\n• Grate carrot.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Cut Japanese tofu into 2cm chunks.\n• In a small bowl, combine garlic, soy sauce mix, the honey and plain flour.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6886bd251cc5cea7128031d7/step-9948a500.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook tofu, tossing, until browned, 3-4 minutes (cook in batches if your pan is getting crowded).\n• Remove pan from heat and add soy sauce mixture, tossing to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6886bd251cc5cea7128031d7/step-aa451210.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, microwave mini flour tortillas on a plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through.\n• In a large bowl, combine apple, carrot, mixed salad leaves, a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6886bd251cc5cea7128031d7/step-663cad20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread tortillas with garlic aioli.\n• Fill with Asian green salad and honey-soy and garlic tofu.\n• Sprinkle over everything garnish (see ingredients) to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6886bd251cc5cea7128031d7/step-a3275630.jpg"
    }
  ]
